'''Vokun''' is a high-ranked [[Skyrim:Dragon Priest|dragon priest]] found in [[Skyrim:High Gate Ruins|High Gate Ruins]], east of Solitude and northeast of [[Skyrim:Ustengrav|Ustengrav]]. As soon as you enter the room with his sarcophagus, he erupts from within and proceeds to attack. As with all dragon priests, he is a formidable undead foe.

Vokun drops his [[Skyrim:Vokun (item)|eponymous mask]] upon death. It grants a 20% reduction in casting cost for all spells from the Conjuration, Illusion and Alteration schools.

Vokun is the guardian of the scroll you must retrieve for [[Skyrim:Anska|Anska]] in the [[Skyrim:A Scroll For Anska|related quest]], as the scroll lies in the chamber behind his crypt. Although he is a shock-based Dragon Priest, he carries a [[SR:Staff of Fireballs|Staff of Fireballs]], which he will use almost exclusively to anything else. Vokun has the ability to summon a [[Skyrim:Storm Atronach|storm atronach]], as well as a [[Skyrim:Lightning Cloak|lightning cloak]] and [[Skyrim:Greater Ward|greater ward]].
